{"text": "Look at what the other session answered:\n\n<pasted_content id=\"3bc4\">\nThree spun-off tasks go to separate sessions; we continue in a later session.\n</pasted_content id=\"3bc4\">", "expect": "miss", "why": "the later session is inside pasted text, not the user's request (2026-09-25)"}
